- ### Ports
+ ### Porte

- A port is written with `tcp"…"` or `udp"…"`. Its type records the transport and, for a
- literal, the number. A port may be named by its
- [IANA service name](https://www.iana.org/assignments/service-names-port-numbers/service-names-port-numbers.xhtml)
- instead of its number, and the name is resolved at compiletime:
+ Una porta si scrive con `tcp"…"` o `udp"…"`. Il suo tipo registra il trasporto e, per un
+ letterale, il numero. Una porta può essere indicata con il suo
+ [nome di servizio IANA](https://www.iana.org/assignments/service-names-port-numbers/service-names-port-numbers.xhtml)
+ anziché con il numero, e il nome viene risolto a tempo di compilazione:

= instead of its number, and the name is resolved at compiletime:
=
- ```scala fuel
+ ```scala fuel

= instead of its number, and the name is resolved at compiletime:
